# name: test_link_styles_snapshot[plain]
  '''
  ---
  title: Scaling Burst
  level: 3
  school: Evocation
  casting_time: 1 action
  range: 30 feet
  components: V, S
  duration: Instantaneous
  concentration: false
  ritual: false
  classes: [Wizard]
  source: XPHB p.1
  data_version: vTEST
  tags: [spell/level/3, spell/school/evocation]
  ---
  
  # Scaling Burst
  
  3rd-level evocation
  
  Each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d6 Fire damage on a failure.
  
  Flammable objects start burning.
  
  ## Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot
  
  The damage increases by 1d6 per slot level.
  
  '''
